  message: "WORK RECORD 2026-10-01 (concurrent run; NOT merged, no PR). Branch jgstern-agent/fix/bivin-go-bare-package-scope in ~/hg_wt/bivin: ddc8438f45 fix(go): resolve a bare identifier in the caller's own package; 30c09f1398 refactor(go): drop the INV-fahub bare-method deferral that can no longer fire.\n\nMechanism: _go_package_scopes keys Pass-1 declarations by (directory, package clause, caller-is-_test.go), excluding methods and fields; the bare call arm, the function-reference-argument arm and the struct-field-reference arm resolve a bare name ONLY in the caller's package (ListNameResolver over that scope, no ambiguity threshold: same-package duplicates are build-constraint variants, bound path-sorted first at 1/sqrt(N)). A name bound in the enclosing declaration is checked first and stays silent. Dot-import fallback unchanged. Answers the NOT-DONE questions: identity = directory (+ package clause for x_test); the external test package is its own scope; non-test files do not see _test.go declarations.\n\nLive repro (the item's): packages a/ b/ c/ each with New(): N=3 was go:external:0-0:New:unresolved for UseA/UseB/TestA, now a/a.go New, b/b.go New, a/a.go New at 0.80; N=2 was UseB -> a/a.go New 0.57, now b/b.go New 0.80.\n\nTests: new packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/tests/test_go_bare_call_package_scope.py (13; on dev 12 fail, the dot-import control passes); TestGoBareMethodMagnetGate's enclosing_class assertion inverted (on dev the stamp let inherited_calls Site-1 bind a compiling package's bare Process() to an embedded type's method at 0.9). Targeted smart-test on 30c09f1398: 9394 passed, 2 xfailed, 302 files, changed sources at 100% coverage, mypy ratchet clean (509 vs baseline 513).\n\nCorpus A/B (analyze_go only; dev 7a645c6c76 vs branch; 8 repos; by call site; record ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_09302026/bivin/): 2,450 external placeholders now bind in-package (alertmanager 132, beads 878, coredns 254, prometheus 521, git-bug 117, jaeger 421, cert-manager 125, runc 2); case 2 = 1,014 wrong-package 0.566 binds now in the caller's package; 21 cross-package binds become the dot-import placeholder; 1,739 previously-resolved sites go silent (sampled: local closures/params/vars bound to a same-named declaration, bare names bound to methods/fields), of which 20 (RHS of x := x(...)) were correct -> WI-bopiv-namah-ribil-homus-pudod-logig-pudov-darik. Filing numbers (124/379) came from a different instrument and are not comparable.\n\nResiduals filed: WI-kibah-kasus-timun-risuk-kilam-birid-dugok-dakuh (selector-form refs), WI-nulig-gipot-samir-movik-latuj-tizin-vagig-lorup (generic instantiation calls), WI-vavas-tavub-lohul-tufot-borip-gatuv-bital-sufaj (Go Site-1 walker), WI-bopiv (above). Full report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_09302026/bivin.md."  # 5be2
